{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In seventeen oh-four,",
   "start": 0.09,
   "end": 1.289
  },
  {
   "text": "a Scottish sailor was left alone on an island,",
   "start": 1.5,
   "end": 4.03
  },
  {
   "text": "and ended up dancing with cats.",
   "start": 4.05,
   "end": 5.813
  },
  {
   "text": "Alexander Selkirk told his captain the ship was going to sink.",
   "start": 6.83,
   "end": 9.99
  },
  {
   "text": "The captain said:",
   "start": 10.44,
   "end": 11.45
  },
  {
   "text": "then stay here.",
   "start": 11.47,
   "end": 12.155
  },
  {
   "text": "He was right.",
   "start": 12.73,
   "end": 13.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The ship sank.",
   "start": 13.64,
   "end": 14.86
  },
  {
   "text": "He was also alone.",
   "start": 14.88,
   "end": 15.886
  },
  {
   "text": "At night,",
   "start": 17.31,
   "end": 17.99
  },
  {
   "text": "rats chewed his feet while he slept.",
   "start": 18.01,
   "end": 19.956
  },
  {
   "text": "So he fed the wild cats goat meat.",
   "start": 20.51,
   "end": 22.559
  },
  {
   "text": "Then more cats.",
   "start": 23.04,
   "end": 23.988
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon,",
   "start": 24.58,
   "end": 24.869
  },
  {
   "text": "hundreds of them slept around him.",
   "start": 25.0,
   "end": 26.717
  },
  {
   "text": "He tamed baby goats too.",
   "start": 27.24,
   "end": 28.392
  },
  {
   "text": "And to pass the time,",
   "start": 28.95,
   "end": 29.937
  },
  {
   "text": "he sang and danced with all of them.",
   "start": 30.28,
   "end": 31.997
  },
  {
   "text": "Four years and four months later,",
   "start": 32.57,
   "end": 34.388
  },
  {
   "text": "a ship finally came.",
   "start": 34.56,
   "end": 35.75
  },
  {
   "text": "Selkirk outran their bulldog to catch them dinner.",
   "start": 36.25,
   "end": 38.895
  },
  {
   "text": "But when he spoke,",
   "start": 39.23,
   "end": 40.13
  },
  {
   "text": "the sailors could barely understand him.",
   "start": 40.15,
   "end": 42.51
  },
  {
   "text": "He'd forgotten how to talk.",
   "start": 42.53,
   "end": 43.764
  },
  {
   "text": "Cats keep away the rats.",
   "start": 45.24,
   "end": 46.457
  },
  {
   "text": "They don't keep away the silence.",
   "start": 47.02,
   "end": 48.548
  },
  {
   "text": "If your days have gone quiet,",
   "start": 49.64,
   "end": 51.2
  },
  {
   "text": "talk to Jenny on Feeloy.",
   "start": 51.22,
   "end": 52.716
  },
  {
   "text": "She always talks back.",
   "start": 52.75,
   "end": 53.871
  },
  {
   "text": "No goats required.",
   "start": 54.33,
   "end": 55.303
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 55.75,
   "end": 57.266
  }
 ]
}